{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49505","headline":"献衷心 · 顾敻","name":"献衷心","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绣鸳鸯帐暖，画孔雀屏欹。\n人悄悄，月明时。\n想昔年欢笑，恨今日分离。\n银釭背，铜漏永，阻佳期。\n小炉烟细，虚阁帘垂。\n几多心事，暗地思惟。\n被娇娥牵役，魂梦如痴。\n金闺里，山枕上，始应知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49505.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49505","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}